  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Peptide</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A high-shine, sheer lip balm with a rich, cushiony texture and moisturizing ingredients that nourish lips for a softer, smoother pout.</p><p><strong>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Balm & Treatment</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong>- Peptides: Stimulate collagen production for visibly plumped, contoured, and volumized lips.</p><p>- Bakuchiol: Improves pigmentation to smooth and soften lips.</p><p>- Blend of Sweet Almond Oil and Coconut Oil: Intensely moisturizes lips.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:</b>-Generously apply to lips for an irresistible wash of shine, moisture, and flavor.-Apply before glam for a moisturizing prep step, then reapply at the end for the perfect finishing touch.-Artistry Tip: For a more full-coverage lip, layer over any shade of PATRICK TA&rsquo;s Precision Lip Crayon or Major Headlines Matte Suede Lipstick (each sold separately).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Peptides: Stimulate collagen production for visibly plumped, contoured, and volumized lips.<br>-Bakuchiol: Improves pigmentation to smooth and soften lips.<br>-Blend of Sweet Almond Oil and Coconut Oil: Intensely moisturizes lips.<br><br>Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Diisostearyl Malate, Microcrystalline Wax, Octyldodecanol, Hydrogenated Poly (C6-14 Olefin), Hydrogenated Styrene/Isoprene Copolymer, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Fragrance (Parfum), Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Phenoxyethanol, Tocopherol, Tribehenin, Tocopheryl Acetate, Hydrogenated Styrene Butadiene Copolymer, Hydrogenated Coconut Oil, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, Stevia Rebaudiana Extract, Dipalmitoyl Hydroxyproline, Sorbitan Isostearate, Benzyl Benzoate, Bakuchiol, Lactic Acid, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Citral, Limonene, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Anise Alcohol, Benzyl Alcohol, Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499), Red 7 (Ci 15850).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Peptide</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A high-shine, sheer lip balm with a rich, cushiony texture and moisturizing ingredients that nourish lips for a softer, smoother pout.</p><p><strong>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Balm & Treatment</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong>- Peptides: Stimulate collagen production for visibly plumped, contoured, and volumized lips.</p><p>- Bakuchiol: Improves pigmentation to smooth and soften lips.</p><p>- Blend of Sweet Almond Oil and Coconut Oil: Intensely moisturizes lips.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:</b>-Generously apply to lips for an irresistible wash of shine, moisture, and flavor.-Apply before glam for a moisturizing prep step, then reapply at the end for the perfect finishing touch.-Artistry Tip: For a more full-coverage lip, layer over any shade of PATRICK TA&rsquo;s Precision Lip Crayon or Major Headlines Matte Suede Lipstick (each sold separately).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Peptides: Stimulate collagen production for visibly plumped, contoured, and volumized lips.<br>-Bakuchiol: Improves pigmentation to smooth and soften lips.<br>-Blend of Sweet Almond Oil and Coconut Oil: Intensely moisturizes lips.<br><br>Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Diisostearyl Malate, Microcrystalline Wax, Octyldodecanol, Hydrogenated Poly (C6-14 Olefin), Hydrogenated Styrene/Isoprene Copolymer, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Fragrance (Parfum), Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Phenoxyethanol, Tocopherol, Tribehenin, Tocopheryl Acetate, Hydrogenated Styrene Butadiene Copolymer, Hydrogenated Coconut Oil, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, Stevia Rebaudiana Extract, Dipalmitoyl Hydroxyproline, Sorbitan Isostearate, Benzyl Benzoate, Bakuchiol, Lactic Acid, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Citral, Limonene, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Anise Alcohol, Benzyl Alcohol, Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499), Red 7 (Ci 15850).</div></details>",
